      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHAMA (6) has a strong winning strike-rate this journey here having won six of eight starts. Comes off a (34.57) win last time, scoring by 5.5 lengths in a Grade 4/5 over 601m at this track. Looks suited and should go close. ASTON RULER (4) is an accomplished stayer with a great record at the longer races. Last start winner over 520m at this track in a Grade 4/5 (29.75) and extra journey suits even better. Form here at this distance is sound including eight wins. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. IRON WORKS (8) was the fastest winner on the program last time out, running away to score by 13 lengths (41.84) at this track. Bold showing expected again. WEST ON MODEL (2) will have admirers after placing last time out.",
